OL,3,ANational security can't come at expense
OL,4,Aof social security, Burnham tells PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Prime Minister's Questions,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Fpresses Andy Burnham on defence
OL,9,Fspending - and when the government will
OL,10,Fspend 3% of GDP on the military
OL,12,FThe prime minister says 3.5% of GDP
OL,13,Fwill be spent by 2035, with a date for
OL,14,Fwhen it will reach 3% to be announced
OL,15,Fin the spending review next year
OL,17,FBadenoch says with threats from
OL,18,FArgentina over the Falklands Islands,
OL,19,Fand from Russia in the North Sea,
OL,20,Fbudgets should increase now
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
